  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HyVpPan.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&color=252a36&labelColor=5865F2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=252A36&labelColor=FF424D&logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&color=252a36&labelColor=1D9BF0&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>简介：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p>Fantasy Ores 对原版 Minecraft 的矿石进行了改进，带来更优质的游戏体验。<br>灵感源自《Hytale》，但融入了我个人的独特风格。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>3D 矿石模型。</li>\n<li>3D 黑曜石和哭泣的黑曜石。</li>\n<li>3D 紫水晶簇。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您想禁用“闪亮矿石”效果，请删除 zip 文件内的 “optifine” 文件夹。<br>模组支持，请点击此处：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores Modded</a> ❤<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>如果您喜欢我的像素艺术风格，也请尝试：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-perspective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Perspective（透视）</a> [兼容多个版本的 Minecraft、其他材质包及模组]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Veganicon</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;快捷栏</a> [需手动下载并复制]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Brewing Guide On（酿造指南开启）</a> [原版]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - Dark mode（深色模式界面）</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - White mode（白色模式界面）</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores by CesarZorak<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores by CesarZorak</a>&nbsp;[模组适配版]</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>💝 致亲爱的 Patreon 支持者 💝</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><em>请记住，您可以在官方的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala Creations Patreon</a></span> 页面上支持我们，那里将提供关于未来更新的信息。<br>这将帮助我们为您提供最高品质的内容。</em></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EjFOwtq.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"550\"></p>",
